It is supposed to be the case, but you should be aware that a patch that's
meant for 3.4.1 might not apply cleanly to 3.4.2, or any other Nethack that
isn't 3.4.1. (Although the needed changes are likely to be small, you won't
know what they are.)

In any case, you aren't supposed to apply the patches by hand; use the
'patch' program.

> And can anyone recommend a good program to use for this?  I don't need
